## 📋 Overview

Welcome to **Rent Car Bogota!** This site serves as an e-commerce storefront for a local vehicle rental business in Bogotá, Colombia. Built entirely with **vanilla JavaScript**, **CSS**, and **HTML** — no frameworks or dependencies required. This build served as the client's MVP, and the design it demonstrated led directly to the client's decision to purchase the full website.

---

## 🗂️ Project Structure

```text
RentCar/
└── assets/
    ├── css/          # Stylesheets
    ├── img/            # Vehicle images
    ├── js/               # JavaScript logic
    └── video/              # Promotional / showcase video assets
```

---

## 🔄 Rental Browsing Flow

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A([👤 Visitor]) -->|Loads| B[index.html]
    B --> C[assets/css]
    B --> D[assets/js/app.js]
    D -->|Renders| E[assets/img\nVehicle Catalog]
    D -->|Plays| F[assets/video\nShowcase Media]
    E --> G([🚗 Rent Car Storefront])
    F --> G

    style A fill:#FFD700,color:#000,stroke:#FFD700
    style D fill:#F7DF1E,color:#000,stroke:#F7DF1E
    style G fill:#000,color:#FFD700,stroke:#FFD700
```

